{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">中歐結束貿易投資磋商例會，雙方達成16項共識，包括探討降低部分商品關稅的可能性。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">國務院副總理何立峰，周五在北京與歐盟委員會貿易和經濟安全委員謝夫喬維奇會面，何立峰強調，中方高度重視發展同歐盟經貿關係。謝夫喬維奇就稱，歐方願加強溝通、共促合作。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.EU-0030_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026DiQETrUuxE1791564232.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"Picture_J.CN.EU-0030_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">商務部部長王文濤與謝夫喬維奇結束中歐貿易投資磋商例會，雙方發表聯合聲明，就貿易和投資平衡、出口管制、知識產權等，達成16條具體成果共識。包括雙方會以符合世貿組織規則方式，就混能車貿易達成諒解，雙方將繼續電動汽車反補貼案，企業價格承諾和復審相關程序，中方對歐洲出口許可審批稀土及永久磁鐵，繼續提供便利。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.EU-0100_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20261kgXzMPp2a1791582861.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"Picture_J.CN.EU-0100_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T22:39:00.829073+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":273,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}